# CONTROL-RECREATE: `cxp teams control --recreate --yes`: a fresh control chat, the old one gets an @mentioned link and is no longer served
# cxp black-box transcript; volatile values are numbered placeholders

== chat <chat:1> "🏠 Codex Control - e2ehost"
   type: meeting; members: owner
-- <msg:1> helper (html)
   | <!-- codex-helper-outbox:<marker> --><p><strong>🔧 Helper:</strong></p>
   | <p>Codex control chat is ready on e2ehost. Send <code>new &lt;directory&gt;</code> to start a session, or <code>help</code>.</p>
-- <msg:2> helper (html)
   | <!-- codex-helper-outbox:<marker> --><p><strong>🔧 Helper:</strong> <at id="0">E2E Owner</at></p>
   | <p>🔁 This chat moved</p>
   | <p>Open the new Control chat:<br>
   | <a href="https://teams.microsoft.com/l/chat/<chat:2>/0?tenantId=e2e00000-0000-4000-8000-00000000te57">https://teams.microsoft.com/l/chat/<chat:2>/0?tenantId=e2e00000-0000-4000-8000-00000000te57</a></p>
   | <p>Messages here may not be handled after the switch.</p>
   mention 0: owner "E2E Owner"
-- <msg:3> owner (html)
   | <p>help</p>

== chat <chat:2> "🏠 Codex Control - e2ehost"
   type: meeting; members: owner
-- <msg:1> helper (html)
   | <!-- codex-helper-outbox:<marker> --><p><strong>🔧 Helper:</strong> <at id="0">E2E Owner</at></p>
   | <p>Control chat recreated.</p>
   mention 0: owner "E2E Owner"
-- <msg:2> helper (html)
   | <!-- codex-helper-outbox:<marker> --><p><strong>🔧 Helper:</strong></p>
   | <p>control chat is ready.</p>
   | <p><strong>🏠 Control chat</strong></p>
   | <p>Use this chat to choose a workspace and create or continue 💬 Work chats.</p>
   | <p>Start here:</p>
   | <ul><li><code>p</code> / <code>projects</code> - choose a workspace</li>
   | <li><code>n &lt;directory&gt;</code> / <code>new &lt;directory&gt;</code> - create a new Work chat for a directory</li>
   | <li><code>new &lt;directory&gt; --model &lt;model&gt;</code> - create a Work chat pinned to a model</li>
   | <li><code>model status|list|switch|reset</code> - inspect or change only this Control chat&#39;s model</li>
   | <li><code>effort status|list|set|reset</code> - inspect or change this Control chat&#39;s reasoning effort</li>
   | <li><code>default status</code> / <code>default model ...</code> / <code>default effort ...</code> - manage global defaults for future launches and chats</li>
   | <li><code>s</code> / <code>sessions</code> - show sessions in the selected workspace</li>
   | <li><code>c &lt;number&gt;</code> / <code>continue &lt;number&gt;</code> - continue an old local Codex session in Teams</li>
   | <li><code>st</code> / <code>status</code> - show active Work chats</li>
   | <li><code>helper rename &lt;title&gt;</code> - rename this Control chat</li>
   | <li><code>helper rename hostname &lt;name&gt;</code> - rename this machine in all related chat titles</li>
   | <li><code>skills</code> - list installed skill subscriptions</li>
   | <li><code>shutdown</code> - stop the helper on all machines until <code>cxp teams start</code> is run on a machine</li>
   | </ul>
   | <p>After <code>p</code>, reply with a number such as <code>1</code> to open that workspace. On a workspace page, send <code>new</code> to create a Work chat in that workspace.</p>
   | <p>For quick helper questions, type the question here. For project work, use a 💬 Work chat.</p>
   | <p>Send <code>help advanced</code> for all commands.</p>
-- <msg:3> owner (html)
   | <p><strong>🧑‍💻 User:</strong></p>
   | <p>help</p>
